00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:42.400
engine with a long tongue but one night edward came to the shed he was a kind little engine and

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:47.720
felt sorry for thomas i've got some freight cars to take home tomorrow if you take them instead of

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:55.260
me i'll push coaches in the yard thank you said thomas that will be nice next morning edward and

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.970
thomas asked their drivers and when they said yes thomas ran off happily to find

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:11.620
freight cars now the freight cars are silly and noisy they talk a lot and don't attend to what

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:17.950
they are doing and i'm sorry to say they play tricks on an engine who is not used to them

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:25.040
edward knew all about the freight cars he warned thomas to be careful but thomas was too excited to

